    `⟨2, 2⟩` with `⟨2, 2⟩ * 1 ≠ ⟨2, 2⟩`, cannot be written here at all,
    since it needs a proof that `gcd 2 2 = 1`, which is false.

    Euclid on fuel is gone with its exhaustion residual: `Nat.gcd` is core,
    it reduces in the kernel, and `decide` settles every rational claim in
    SECTIONS 4B, 4D and 14 on it, the Landauer constants included, in the
